  "summary": "Thanks to a good friend of ours my family has access to a great townhouse in Park City, UT. As I’m sure you can imagine, we all love to get out of the sun from time to time and go play in the wonderful snow of Utah! I didn’t get any pictures on the slopes, but here are a few shots from our trip while Madison and I were playing in the snow around the townhouse.",
